{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15344","headline":"送戴徵士还山 · 李端","name":"送戴徵士还山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"柔桑锦臆雉，相送到烟霞。\n独隐空山里，闲门几树花。\n草生杨柳岸，鸟啭竹林家。\n不是谋生拙，无爲末路赊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李端","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15344.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15344","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}